#: templates/landing.html:946
msgid "About Keydion"
msgstr "关于 Keydion"

#: templates/landing.html:947
msgid ""
"Keydion is an academic asset platform designed for high school research. "
"We focus on student\n"
"            scholarship — IA, EE, TOK, and independent projects — "
"ensuring that excellent work is systematically\n"
"            preserved, searchable, and citable."
msgstr ""
"Keydion 是一个专为高中设计的学术资产平台。我们聚焦于学生的科研成果，包括 IA、EE、TOK "
"等项目。通过本平台，学生的研究成果将不再被忽视，而是被系统性地保存于 Keydion "
"数据库中，供师生查阅与参考。同时，教师也可以更全面地了解本校科研项目的内容与整体质量。"

#: templates/landing.html:953
msgid "Papers"
msgstr "论文数"

#: templates/landing.html:961
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "学科类别"

#: templates/landing.html:966
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "学术使命"

#: templates/landing.html:967
msgid ""
"By building a living archive of student research, we help schools "
"maintain academic integrity,\n"
"            prevent topic collisions, and let each cohort build on the "
"discoveries of the last."
msgstr ""
"Keydion "
"同样致力于维护学术诚信，避免撞题以及学术不端误判。我们希望为每一所学校留存这些珍贵的学术成果，让优秀的学生研究经验得以传承，使学术探索不再只是一次性的作业，而成为可以持续积累与发展的知识资产。"

#: templates/landing.html:977
msgid "Ready to explore?"
